# The debugger engine's native check (DBG-001, headless --test debug-engine):
# attaches to debug-demo through its debug-target service (cooperative,
# read-only), and checks real threads, frames, lines, locals, values and the
# data-structure graph against what the demo is doing.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "com.cubit.debug-engine-check"
  version => "0.1.0"
  requests => [
    (service "debug-target" "target")
    # The demo's build-id debug file and its sources, read only.
    (service "filesystem" "filesystem")
    # ABI-002: its debug text (CuBit.Console_Route).
    (service "logstore" "logstore")]
  optional => ["logstore"]
  scopes => [(filesystem [File_Right.Read] "@system/Debug/")])
